        goggles</b></i> tool can be used to make <i>hidden platforms</i> appear.
        The area that a hidden platform will fill will be highlighted <color=purple>purple</color>.
        Pressing the <b>"Q"</b> key will allow the platforms to appear so you can
        walk across.'
